 what this prep Task exists to prevent. Scope is otherwise respected (no unrelated changes), but the Task's stated objective is not genuinely met for standalone-record, validation-checks and the companion header despite the narrow named test passing.","data":{"kind":"build-round","round":{"testsPassed":true,"typecheckClean":true}}}}}
